#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with "
"quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms "
"using Qiskit Runtime primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing "
"professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of "
"variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk individu yang memiliki beberapa pengalaman dengan"
" komputasi kuantum dan ingin belajar cara menulis algoritma variasional "
"menggunakan Qiskit Runtime primitives. Ini juga cocok untuk para profesional"
" komputasi kuantum yang ingin memperluas pengetahuan dan keterampilan mereka"
" di bidang algoritma variasional.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Ujian {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Variational algorithm design, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the "
"lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by "
"Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendapatkan lencana Desain algoritma variasional, ikuti ujian di "
"IBM&reg; Training. Ujian ini dimaksudkan untuk diikuti setelah membaca "
"pelajaran-pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah Anda lulus ujian, Anda akan "
"diberitahu oleh Credly bahwa Anda telah mendapatkan lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
