#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor "
"authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the "
"administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an "
"IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge"
" earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification "
"from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal "
"information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and "
"operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with "
"IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner "
"consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be "
"viewed [here.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) IBM employees can view "
"the IBM Internal Privacy Statement "
"[here.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
msgstr ""
"PEMBERITAHUAN: IBM memanfaatkan layanan Credly, prosesor data pihak ketiga "
"yang diizinkan oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Serikat, untuk membantu "
"administrasi program IBM Digital Badge. Agar dapat menerbitkan IBM Digital "
"Badge untukmu, informasi pribadimu (nama, alamat email, dan lencana yang "
"diperoleh) akan dibagikan kepada Credly. Kamu akan menerima notifikasi email"
" dari Credly dengan instruksi untuk mengklaim lencana. Informasi pribadimu "
"digunakan untuk menerbitkan lencana dan untuk pelaporan program serta tujuan"
" operasional. IBM dapat membagikan informasi pribadi yang dikumpulkan kepada"
" anak perusahaan dan pihak ketiga IBM secara global. Itu akan ditangani "
"secara konsisten dengan praktik privasi IBM. Pernyataan Privasi IBM dapat "
"dilihat [di sini.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Karyawan IBM dapat "
"melihat Pernyataan Privasi Internal IBM [di "
"sini.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
